- Evaluates approach to atomic debit/credit across rows with proper compensation.

## Key Concepts
- SERIALIZABLE isolation / SSI
- FOR UPDATE row locking across multiple rows
- Idempotency via a unique transfer_id
- Retry/backoff for serialization failures
- Audit/log integrity for immutable ledger

